This product includes software developed by the MDBrain project, notably
the wiki engine (packages/wiki-engine), the HTTP API, client, MCP server and
web console it grew from. SQRRL's changes include its own raw-item layer and
distillers (packages/source-layer), the source connectors, people identity,
task review, the transcriber and the removal of the Memongo memory layer.

